  "title": "Why Crypto Payments Are the Future of Consumer Retail Commerce",
  "summary": "Consumers do not change how they pay just because technology improves. They change when they gain an advantage, whether that is easier, cheaper, or simply ‘better’. Some may also highlight “trust,” but that is a hygiene factor, not a motivator. Until recently, crypto payments did not meet this standard. They were more difficult, slower, clunkier,...",
